      <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: center;line-height: 24px;font-size: 15px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #8a877f;left: 493px;top: 1227px;width: 453px;height: 15px;position: absolute;">Scent Your Space<br></span>
      <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: center;line-height: 24px;font-size: 15px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #8a877f;left: 493px;top: 1245px;width: 453px;height: 15px;position: absolute;">Turn Every Room into Summer</span>
      <div style="overflow: hidden;left: 0px;top: 8760px;aspect-ratio: 0.75;width: auto;height: 965px;position: absolute;"><img src="images/6f54b96858683a418578902db44a4e268615d074.png" alt="图片生成-1767958996811 2" style="inset: 0;width: 100%;height: 100%;position: absolute;object-fit: cover;"></div>
