      <div style="overflow: hidden;left: 41px;top: 3152px;width: 1345px;height: 562px;position: absolute;">
        <div data-rv="right" data-rv-dist="340" data-rv-delay="1" style="overflow: hidden;left: 432px;top: 0px;aspect-ratio: 0.82;width: auto;height: 562px;position: absolute;"><img src="images/e0e203aa36f8119658f27f05092931a83b6385a7.png" alt="image 17" style="inset: 0;width: 100%;height: 100%;position: absolute;transform: translate(20px,0px) scale(0.91,1);"></div>
        <div data-rv="right" data-rv-dist="340" data-rv-delay="2" style="overflow: hidden;left: 929px;top: 34px;aspect-ratio: 0.82;width: auto;height: 506px;position: absolute;"><img src="images/23709fcf191defca326256d705d13224a4cdb4f5.png" alt="image 18" style="inset: 0;width: 100%;height: 100%;position: absolute;object-fit: cover;"></div>
        <div data-rv="right" data-rv-dist="340" data-rv-delay="0" style="overflow: hidden;left: 0px;top: 34px;aspect-ratio: 0.82;width: auto;height: 506px;position: absolute;"><img src="images/5c0d9c6055a4d74a6b9e4a0c1a9024b6d3d2d4d1.png" alt="image 19" style="inset: 0;width: 100%;height: 100%;position: absolute;object-fit: cover;"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="overflow: hidden;display: flex;flex-direction: column;row-gap: 36px;align-items: start;justify-content: flex-start;left: 64px;top: 355px;width: 1312px;position: absolute;">
        <div style="overflow: hidden;display: flex;flex-direction: row;grid-column-gap: 0px;align-items: start;justify-content: flex-start;width: 100%;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;"><span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 16px;font-size: 12px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;text-transform: uppercase;color: #55544f;width: 336px;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;">Project Background</span><span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 24px;font-size: 15px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #11110f;width: 528px;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;">This seasonal packaging concept develops a Summer collection for Sydney Candle Co, presented in the project brief as an Australian coastal lifestyle brand. The collection includes three reed diffuser variants, each representing a different summer mood.</span></div>
        <div style="overflow: hidden;display: flex;flex-direction: row;grid-column-gap: 0px;align-items: start;justify-content: flex-start;width: 100%;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;"><span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 16px;font-size: 12px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;text-transform: uppercase;color: #55544f;width: 336px;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;">Design Scope</span><span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 24px;font-size: 15px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #11110f;width: 528px;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;">Packaging Design · Botanical Illustration · Surface Pattern · Colour System </span></div>
        <div style="overflow: hidden;display: flex;flex-direction: row;grid-column-gap: 0px;align-items: start;justify-content: flex-start;width: 100%;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;"><span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 16px;font-size: 12px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;text-transform: uppercase;color: #55544f;width: 336px;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;">Design Approach</span><span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 24px;font-size: 15px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #11110f;width: 588px;position: relative;flex-shrink: 0;">Botanical patterns and colour-coded variants translate the character of each fragrance into a distinct visual atmosphere. Blue, yellow and pink create clear differentiation, while a repeated label structure and consistent information hierarchy connect the products as one collection. The system balances individual product personality with overall brand recognition.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div style="background-color: #f4f1e9;overflow: hidden;left: 0px;top: 0px;width: 1440px;height: 342px;position: absolute;">
        <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 16px;font-size: 12px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #55544f;left: 56px;top: 116px;width: 500px;position: absolute;">PACKAGING · DESIGN</span>
        <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 66px;font-size: 64px;font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;letter-spacing: -1px;color: #11110f;left: 56px;top: 150px;width: 1100px;position: absolute;">Sydney Candle Co</span>
        <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 16px;font-size: 12px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #55544f;left: 56px;top: 290px;width: 140px;position: absolute;">← ALL WORK</span>
        <div style="background-color: #b8b4aa;left: 56px;top: 78px;width: 1328px;height: 1px;position: absolute;"></div>
      </div>
      <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 26px;font-size: 17px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #55544f;left: 840px;top: 5198px;width: 456px;position: absolute;">A warm yellow palette and beach light translate the citrus fragrance into an energetic summer atmosphere. The photographic direction extends the colour-coded packaging into a broader sensory world.</span>
      <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 56px;font-size: 52px;font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;letter-spacing: -0.5px;color: #55544f;left: 840px;top: 5118px;width: 480px;position: absolute;">Sun-Kissed / Wild Orange</span>
      <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 26px;font-size: 17px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #55544f;left: 96px;top: 7262px;width: 456px;position: absolute;">Pink architectural details and flowering forms create a softer, romantic interpretation of summer, echoing the botanical linework and blush packaging of the floral variant.</span>
      <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 56px;font-size: 52px;font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;letter-spacing: -0.5px;color: #55544f;left: 96px;top: 7110px;width: 480px;position: absolute;">Summer, Another / Flower Garden</span>
      <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 26px;font-size: 17px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #55544f;left: 840px;top: 9243px;width: 456px;position: absolute;">Backlit linen and quiet neutral tones express the collection’s softest fragrance. The restrained imagery balances the denser botanical pattern used across the blue packaging.</span>
      <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 56px;font-size: 52px;font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;letter-spacing: -0.5px;color: #55544f;left: 840px;top: 9109px;width: 480px;position: absolute;">Summer Breeze / Calm Plush</span>
      <div style="background-color: #f4f1e9;overflow: hidden;left: 0px;top: 9775px;width: 1440px;height: 320px;position: absolute;">
        <div style="background-color: rgba(15,15,14,0.28);left: 64px;top: 0px;width: 1312px;height: 1px;position: absolute;"></div>
        <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 16px;font-size: 12px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.5px;color: rgba(15,15,14,0.65);left: 64px;top: 72px;width: max-content;position: absolute;">NEXT PROJECT</span>
        <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 16px;font-size: 12px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: rgba(15,15,14,0.65);left: 64px;top: 104px;width: max-content;position: absolute;">COLOUR U</span>
        <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: right;line-height: 56px;font-size: 52px;font-family: &quot;Instrument Serif&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #0f0f0e;left: 1016px;top: 74px;width: 360px;height: 64px;position: absolute;">NEXT →</span>
      </div>
      <div style="background-color: #f4f1e9;left: 0px;top: 0px;width: 1440px;height: 80px;position: absolute;">
        <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 16px;font-size: 12px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #11110f;left: 32px;top: 32px;width: 160px;position: absolute;">GEMMA YANG</span>
        <span class="text" style="display: inline;text-align: left;line-height: 16px;font-size: 12px;font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: 100%;color: #11110f;left: 182px;top: 32px;width: 60px;position: absolute;">WORK</span>
